#>texture_cast_resin
#:material #!polymer

~cast-resin[polymer]{moulded studs, satin gloss, embossed grain}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~cast-resin[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "cast resin"
science: "Long chain molecules, moulded or cast; the mould's surface is copied exactly, so studs, grain and gloss are all made on purpose."
